<title>JAPAN: JGB futures end down, medium-end cash bonds weak.</title>
<headline>JGB futures end down, medium-end cash bonds weak.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Key December JGB futures ended session down, medium-yield JGBs weak in particular in cash bond market.</p>
<p>*Market climbed in morning on tumble in Tokyo stocks, but shed gains as stocks recovered.</p>
<p>*Talk of supplementary budget also weighed on market.</p>
</text>
